 - Compatibility regressions verify reading existing ChaCha20-Poly1305 ciphertext, rejecting tampering and using isolated credential-store test identities.
 
+## Fixed
+- AI CLI stdin processing: robust handling for piped inputs and non-blocking stream closure in headless operations.
+- Browser proxy error recovery: fail-closed feedback and retry backoff on upstream HTTP 503 Service Unavailable responses.
+- Render worker lifecycle: resolve concurrency race condition between worker termination stop requests and active polling status probes.
+
